WEBVTT

00:00:05.092 --> 00:00:07.572
[ METAL CREAKING ]

00:00:24.285 --> 00:00:27.636
[ INDISTINCT WHISPERS ]

00:00:34.730 --> 00:00:39.517
THESE ARE DARK TIMES,
THERE IS NO DENYING.

00:00:39.561 --> 00:00:42.825
OUR WORLD HAS, PERHAPS,
FACED NO GREATER THREAT

00:00:42.868 --> 00:00:45.306
THAN IT DOES TODAY.

00:00:45.349 --> 00:00:50.267
BUT I SAY THIS
TO OUR CITIZENRY --

00:00:50.311 --> 00:00:54.315
WE, EVER YOUR SERVANTS,

00:00:54.358 --> 00:00:57.187
WILL CONTINUE
TO DEFEND YOUR LIBERTY

00:00:57.231 --> 00:01:01.061
AND REPEL THE FORCES
THAT SEEK TO TAKE IT FROM YOU.

00:01:02.888 --> 00:01:05.500
YOUR MINISTRY...

00:01:05.543 --> 00:01:08.546
REMAINS...

00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:10.592
STRONG.

00:01:10.635 --> 00:01:13.551
[ CAMERA SHUTTERS CLICKING ]

00:01:27.609 --> 00:01:29.567
Mrs. Granger: HERMIONE!
TEA'S READY, DARLING.

00:01:29.611 --> 00:01:31.700
COMING, MUM!

00:01:34.877 --> 00:01:38.010
Vernon: COME ON, DUDLEY.
HURRY UP.

00:01:38.054 --> 00:01:41.318
I-I S-- I STILL DON'T UNDERSTAND
WHY WE HAVE TO LEAVE.

00:01:41.362 --> 00:01:45.540
BECAUSE [GRUNTS] IT'S NOT SAFE
FOR US HERE ANYMORE.

00:01:45.583 --> 00:01:49.065
[ GRUNTS, SIGHS ]

00:02:01.295 --> 00:02:02.818
RON!

00:02:02.861 --> 00:02:05.777
TELL YOUR FATHER
SUPPER'S NEARLY READY!

00:02:08.258 --> 00:02:10.217
[ SIGHS ]

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:11.827
Mr. Granger: IS THIS
THAT AUSTRALIA THING?

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:14.046
MM. LOOKS WONDERFUL,
DOESN'T IT?

00:02:14.090 --> 00:02:18.877
Man:
...STRETCHING 3,500 KILOMETERS
ALONG AUSTRALIA'S EAST COAST

00:02:18.921 --> 00:02:20.966
FROM DARWIN ISLAND...

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:22.751
OBLIVIATE.

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:01.181
[ VEHICLE DEPARTS ]

00:03:46.313 --> 00:03:48.532
[ WHOOSHING ]

00:04:29.704 --> 00:04:32.620
[ INDISTINCT TALKING
AND LAUGHTER ]

00:04:32.663 --> 00:04:35.405
[ SOBBING SOFTLY ]

00:04:36.406 --> 00:04:38.800
Voldemort: SEVERUS.

00:04:38.843 --> 00:04:42.412
I WAS BEGINNING TO WORRY
YOU HAD LOST YOUR WAY.

00:04:42.456 --> 00:04:45.937
COME.
WE'VE SAVED YOU A SEAT.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:51.813
YOU BRING NEWS, I TRUST?

00:04:51.856 --> 00:04:55.599
IT WILL HAPPEN SATURDAY NEXT
AT NIGHTFALL.

00:04:55.643 --> 00:04:58.123
Yaxley: I'VE HEARD
DIFFERENTLY, MY LORD.

00:04:58.167 --> 00:05:00.343
DAWLISH, THE AUROR,
HAS LET SLIP

00:05:00.387 --> 00:05:02.606
THAT THE POTTER BOY
WILL NOT BE MOVED

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:04.695
UNTIL THE 30th
OF THIS MONTH.

00:05:04.739 --> 00:05:06.436
THE DAY BEFORE
HE TURNS 17.

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:10.005
THIS IS A FALSE TRAIL.

00:05:10.048 --> 00:05:12.660
THE AUROR OFFICE
NO LONGER PLAYS ANY PART

00:05:12.703 --> 00:05:14.662
IN THE PROTECTION
OF HARRY POTTER.

00:05:14.705 --> 00:05:16.446
THOSE CLOSEST TO HIM

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:18.535
BELIEVE WE HAVE INFILTRATED
THE MINISTRY.

00:05:18.579 --> 00:05:21.059
WELL [CHUCKLES] THEY GOT
THAT RIGHT, HAVEN'T THEY?

00:05:21.103 --> 00:05:24.019
[ LAUGHTER ]

00:05:24.062 --> 00:05:28.284
WHAT SAY YOU, PIUS?

00:05:31.505 --> 00:05:33.855
ONE HEARS MANY THINGS,
MY LORD.

00:05:33.898 --> 00:05:37.075
WHETHER THE TRUTH IS AMONG THEM
IS NOT CLEAR.

00:05:37.119 --> 00:05:38.512
[ CHUCKLES ]

00:05:38.555 --> 00:05:40.818
SPOKEN LIKE
A TRUE POLITICIAN.

00:05:40.862 --> 00:05:43.908
YOU WILL, I THINK,
PROVE MOST USEFUL, PIUS.

00:05:46.128 --> 00:05:48.696
WHERE WILL HE BE TAKEN,
THE BOY?

00:05:48.739 --> 00:05:50.785
Snape:
TO A SAFE HOUSE.

00:05:50.828 --> 00:05:53.483
MOST LIKELY THE HOME
OF SOMEONE IN THE ORDER.

00:05:53.527 --> 00:05:55.180
I'M TOLD
IT'S BEEN GIVEN

00:05:55.224 --> 00:05:57.400
EVERY MANNER
OF PROTECTION POSSIBLE.

00:05:57.444 --> 00:06:01.361
ONCE THERE, IT WILL BE
IMPRACTICAL TO ATTACK HIM.

00:06:01.404 --> 00:06:03.450
Bellatrix:
[ CLEARS THROAT ] MY LORD.

00:06:03.493 --> 00:06:06.148
I'D LIKE TO VOLUNTEER MYSELF
FOR THIS TASK.

00:06:06.191 --> 00:06:07.671
I WANT KILL THE BOY.[ INDISTINCT SHOUTING
IN DISTANCE ]

00:06:07.715 --> 00:06:09.064
WORMTAIL!

00:06:09.107 --> 00:06:10.761
[ SIGHS ]

00:06:10.805 --> 00:06:12.981
HAVE I NOT SPOKEN TO YOU
ABOUT KEEPING OUR GUEST QUIET?

00:06:13.024 --> 00:06:15.026
YES, M-MY LORD.

00:06:15.070 --> 00:06:16.593
RIGHT AWAY, MY LORD.

00:06:16.637 --> 00:06:18.203
[ GASPS ]

00:06:18.247 --> 00:06:22.599
AS INSPIRING AS I FIND
YOUR BLOODLUST, BELLATRIX,

00:06:22.643 --> 00:06:26.342
I MUST BE THE ONE
TO KILL HARRY POTTER.

00:06:28.475 --> 00:06:29.954
BUT...

00:06:29.998 --> 00:06:33.610
I FACE AN UNFORTUNATE
COMPLICATION --

00:06:33.654 --> 00:06:39.007
THAT MY WAND AND POTTER'S
SHARE THE SAME CORE.

00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:44.621
THEY ARE, IN SOME WAYS...

00:06:44.665 --> 00:06:46.623
TWINS.

00:06:46.667 --> 00:06:52.542
WE CAN WOUND BUT NOT
FATALLY HARM ONE ANOTHER.

00:06:52.586 --> 00:06:56.328
IF I AM TO KILL HIM,

00:06:56.372 --> 00:06:59.854
I MUST DO IT
WITH ANOTHER'S WAND.

00:07:02.378 --> 00:07:04.293
COME...

00:07:04.336 --> 00:07:07.557
SURELY ONE OF YOU
WOULD LIKE THE HONOR?

00:07:09.603 --> 00:07:12.170
HMM?

00:07:12.214 --> 00:07:16.044
[ INHALES SHARPLY ]
WHAT ABOUT YOU...

00:07:16.087 --> 00:07:17.959
LUCIUS?

00:07:20.222 --> 00:07:21.832
My Lord?

00:07:21.876 --> 00:07:25.096
[ Mockingly ]
MY LORD?

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:27.969
[ Normal voice ]
I REQUIRE YOUR WAND.

00:07:28.796 --> 00:07:31.842
[ SIGHS ]

